<title>TURKEY: Turkey's five-year Eurodollar expected next week.</title>
<headline>Turkey's five-year Eurodollar expected next week.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey is expected to launch a five-year Eurobond issue next week, banking sources said on Friday.</p>
<p>Turkish treasury officials were on a roadshow in Asian, European and U.S. financial centres this week ahead of the issue of at least $250 million.</p>
<p>Bankers say JP Morgan and SBC Warburg will underwrite part of the deal.</p>
<p>They expect the issue to be set on April 16 or 17.</p>
</text>
